for the Makefile build, from the install prefix for the CMake build.
Its
.I libc/
(the C library and curses) is searched for C input the same way, with
no
.BR \-I .
.TP
.I /usr/local/Vircon32/v32tools/docs/v32c++
The documents (CMake install only).
.PP
.I v32tools/
is shared by the community Vircon32 tools: v32lua's headers go in
.IR v32tools/include/v32lua ,
beside these. On Windows, the CMake install (default prefix
.IR "C:\eProgram Files\eVircon32" )
puts the transpiler in
